---
layout: app-layout.njk
title: Passkeys – Climbing Logbook
bundle: account-passkeys
headerClass: mb-6
---
<div class="max-w-[960px] mx-auto">
  <a class="back-link mt-4 mb-5" id="back-to-account-link" href="#">
    <svg class="w-[.9rem] h-[.9rem] stroke-current fill-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"></path><path d="M19 12H5"></path></svg>
    My Account
  </a>

  <h1 class="section-heading">Passkeys</h1>

  <div class="max-w-[520px] flex flex-col gap-4">
    <p class="text-sm text-muted">A passkey lets you log in with your fingerprint, face or device PIN instead of your password and a code. Your phone or computer can keep it, or a password manager such as <a class="text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-2" href="https://proton.me/pass">Proton Pass</a>. Your fingerprint or face never leaves your device. <a class="text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-2" href="/help/passkeys/">How it works</a></p>

    <p class="text-sm text-muted" id="passkeys-loading">Loading…</p>
    <p class="text-sm" id="passkeys-unsupported" hidden>This browser doesn't support passkeys. You can still log in with your password and, if you've turned it on, a code from your authenticator app.</p>

    <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 list-none p-0" id="passkeys-list" hidden></ul>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted" id="passkeys-empty" hidden>You haven't added a passkey yet.</p>

    <div class="row-card flex flex-col gap-3" id="passkeys-reauth" hidden>
      <p class="text-sm">To add a passkey, log in again first. It's been more than a day since you last did, and a fresh login makes sure it's really you adding it.</p>
      <div><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="passkeys-reauth-btn">Log in again</button></div>
    </div>

    <form class="row-card flex flex-col gap-3" id="add-passkey-form" hidden novalidate>
      <label class="text-sm" for="passkey-name">Name it, so you can tell your passkeys apart</label>
      <input class="text-input w-full" type="text" id="passkey-name" maxlength="50" placeholder="My phone" required>
      <div><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="add-passkey-btn">Add a passkey</button></div>
    </form>

    <p class="error-message" id="passkeys-error" role="alert" aria-live="assertive" tabindex="-1" hidden></p>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted" id="passkeys-info" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
  </div>
</div>
